<title>GREECE: TABLE OF GREEK CENTRAL BANK FIXING RATES, MAY 6.</title>
<headline>TABLE OF GREEK CENTRAL BANK FIXING RATES, MAY 6.</headline>
<dateline>ATHENS 1997-05-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Greece's fixing</p>
<p>rates for leading currencies on Tuesday were as follows.</p>
<p>--------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p> Currency:	May 06	May 05   Dec 31 96    NET</p>
<p>--------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>- USD =	  274.590     274.500     247.020   11.16 %</p>
<p>- ECU =	  309.750     309.970     306.830    0.95 %</p>
<p>- DEM =	  158.830     158.900     158.970   -0.09 %</p>
<p>- FRF =	   47.074	47.098	47.182   -0.23 %</p>
<p>- GBP =	  447.340     444.740     419.180    6.72 %</p>
<p>- NLG =	  141.205     141.285     141.685   -0.34 %</p>
<p>- ITL (100) =   16.052	16.055	16.185   -0.82 %</p>
<p>- JPY (100) =  218.250     217.020     212.430    2.74 %</p>
<p>- ESP =	    1.882	 1.885	 1.888   -0.32 %</p>
<p>- PTE =	    1.580	 1.582	 1.581    0.06 %</p>
<p>- CHF =	  186.590     186.520     183.135    1.89 %</p>
<p>Note: The percentage net change is calculated as the percentage</p>
<p>difference between the most recent fixing rate and the December</p>
<p>31, 1996 rate.</p>
<p>--Angelos Kiosklis, Athens Newsroom +301 3311812-4</p>
